# lantern-out-form.trk -- one row per bar (48), slewed in the patch.
track keys  cva   # 1  piano (melody and chords)
track organ cva   # 2
track drive cva   # 3  rotary horn rate (Surge normalized): slow -> fast in B
track cello cva   # 4
track tine  cva   # 5
track kit   cva   # 6  brushes, rim, kick
track vinyl cva   # 7  track 1's crackle, back at the end
track verb  cva   # 8
track main  cva   # 9

pattern form 48
#    keys   organ  drive  cello  tine   kit    vinyl  verb   main
00 | 1    | 0    | .3   | 0    | 0    | 0    | 0    | .7   | 1     # intro: the piano alone
08 | 1    | .6>  | .3   | .7   | 0    | .5   | 0    | .55  | .     # A
15 | .    | .8   | .    | .    | .    | .7   | .    | .    | .
16 | .    | .8   | .3>  | .8   | .    | .8   | .    | .    | .
24 | 1    | .9   | .7   | .9   | 0    | .9   | 0    | .5   | .     # B: the horn speeds up
31 | .    | .    | .7>  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .
32 | .    | .85  | .4   | .85  | .    | .8   | .    | .    | .     # A again, settling
36 | 1    | .9   | .5   | .9   | .    | .9   | .    | .    | .     # B
40 | 1    | 0    | .3   | 0    | .9   | 0    | .6>  | .75  | .     # coda: piano, the tine, crackle
45 | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | 1>
47 | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | 1    | .    | 0

order form
